      "id": "claim_5eb89bcf8ddd4ee5b4723de263876537",
      "statement": "Every decline — whether from the growth check (step 4) or from the model's decline tool (step 5) — writes an anonymous record to the declines table via insights.application.DeclineLogService: subject_ids, PII-scrubbed question text, best retrieval score, reason, and timestamp, with no user_id stored; entries are deleted after 90 days.",
