      "id": "claim_40a4c642138b4adf8c3b72af25648110",
      "statement": "The RAG MCP server validates the forwarded JWT in code, reads the user sub, and applies a can_read SQL predicate to restrict chunk search to the caller's own ready, non-archived documents in the requested subjects; the agent passes the JWT in an HTTP header, never in the prompt.",
