      "id": "claim_da054704c11344e7b3f45c3d331a04e9",
      "statement": "The summarize path reads the thread, optionally asks the learner to confirm if the note was edited since last generated, makes one model call that returns the Lesson Note and calls the save_learning_record tool, then upserts both the LessonNote (one per thread) and the LearningRecord (in the LangGraph store under namespace (learning, user_id), keyed by thread_id).",
