      "id": "claim_eda601b5420d4c29b16dd1c6f622f84e",
      "statement": "The tutoring module owns the Thread domain object, DetectionPolicy, RelevanceGate, and GrowthPolicy domain classes, and the SubjectDetector, AskService, and ConversationService application services; it retrieves chunks only through the Retriever port, implemented by an MCP client adapter, never by reading chunk tables directly.",
