    {
      "id": "claim_9177ee0da9a84e32a4429b6c135be24f",
      "statement": "Chunk text passed to the model is always wrapped as quoted data with an explicit instruction that document content must never be treated as instructions (PRD D7); because subjects and the readable document set are determined by code and SQL — not by the prompt — document-embedded prompt-injection attacks have no effect on scope or access. LangSmith traces every agent run; traces are deleted after 180 days.",
